---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<section class="contact-section" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow light-eyebrow"><span></span>LET’S CONNECT</span><h2>Good things start<br />with a <em>conversation.</em></h2><p>Have a role, a project, or an interesting problem that connects business and technology? I’d be happy to hear from you.</p><div class="contact-location"><Icon name="location" size={18} />{profile.location}</div></div><div class="contact-card"><span class="contact-card-label">SAY HELLO</span><a class="contact-email" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}<Icon name="external" size={24} /></a><div class="contact-card-actions"><button type="button" data-copy-email={profile.email}><Icon name="copy" size={16} />Copy email</button><a href={`tel:${profile.phoneLink}`}><Icon name="phone" size={16} />{profile.phone}</a></div><div class="contact-divider"></div><div class="contact-profile-links"><a href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="linkedin" />LinkedIn<Icon name="external" size={16} /></a><a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="github" />GitHub<Icon name="external" size={16} /></a></div></div></div>
</section>
